  "title": "Sinclair Names Kevin Beard as Vice President and General Manager of KGAN and KFXA in Cedar Rapids - Sinclair, Inc",
  "summary": "Cedar Rapids, IA, May 26, 2026 — Sinclair today announced the appointment of Kevin Beard as Vice President and General Manager of KGAN/CBS2 Iowa and KFXA in Cedar Rapids, IA. Beard joins Sinclair from Allen Media Group where he has held several sales leadership positions, most recently Station Manager/General Sales Manager for WSIL in Marion, IL...",
